Amstrad CPC emulation uses CPCJS (https://github.com/smichea/cpcjs), a
WebAssembly port of Caprice32 (https://github.com/ColinPitrat/caprice32).
CPCJS and Caprice32 are distributed under GPL-2.0. The cpcjs build packages
Caprice32's CPC ROM images; retain the upstream copyright and license notices
when redistributing this vendored runtime.
